{"5030120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Amrit Manthanam", "steam_appid": 5030120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE BATTLE FOR AMRIT BEGINS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy hordes are advancing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Amrit Manthanam, every battlefield is a test of positioning, timing, and strategy. Deploy mythology-inspired heroes across the battlefield, combine their unique strengths, unleash powerful abilities at critical moments, and stop relentless waves of enemies before they break through your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory isn't just about having stronger heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's about knowing who to deploy, where to position them, and when to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛡️ DEFEND AGAINST THE HORDE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every wave brings a new threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your heroes at strategic positions across the battlefield and build a defense capable of holding back increasingly dangerous enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the battlefield. Adapt your formation. Strengthen weak points. Make every position count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the pressure rises, one decision can be the difference between a perfect defense and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/c6ae870aefcd8b6a641668b0d5e1404a.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/c6ae870aefcd8b6a641668b0d5e1404a.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/c6ae870aefcd8b6a641668b0d5e1404a.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/924787e93254634049a768e3895c9b41.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/924787e93254634049a768e3895c9b41.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/924787e93254634049a768e3895c9b41.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚔️ COMMAND LEGENDARY HEROES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your heroes aren't interchangeable towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero brings a distinct combat role and can change how you approach the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Indravarma — The Divine Guardian</strong></u><br>Blessed by Indra, Indravarma stands at the frontline, using his durability and close-range attacks to hold enemies back while the rest of your forces strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/1a43886dba8cef6bc27624cdc4730356.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/1a43886dba8cef6bc27624cdc4730356.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/1a43886dba8cef6bc27624cdc4730356.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Surya Veer — The Radiant Warrior</strong></u><br>Channel the power of the sun through devastating ranged and area attacks capable of burning through groups of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/7f528539b230c51352b09dcd42ef2ead.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/7f528539b230c51352b09dcd42ef2ead.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/7f528539b230c51352b09dcd42ef2ead.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Amrita Devi — The Celestial Healer</strong></u><br><br><br>Harness the sacred power of Amrit to heal nearby allies and strengthen their effectiveness in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/2ab9f6802c6a788e111b9d2ba5d88a26.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/2ab9f6802c6a788e111b9d2ba5d88a26.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/2ab9f6802c6a788e111b9d2ba5d88a26.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Sharanga — The Divine Archer</strong></u><br>Strike enemies from afar with exceptional speed, range, and precision before they can reach your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/9b410a460255577d2a5cda9ed1017c3e.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/9b410a460255577d2a5cda9ed1017c3e.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/9b410a460255577d2a5cda9ed1017c3e.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Brihaspati — Guru of the Devas</strong></u><br>Command mystical and cosmic powers to summon additional forces and reinforce your defense when the battlefield becomes overwhelming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/a387f15b32271a9c89397ac1b3461cb0.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/a387f15b32271a9c89397ac1b3461cb0.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/a387f15b32271a9c89397ac1b3461cb0.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your formation around their strengths and discover combinations capable of surviving even the fiercest assaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>☄️ TURN THE TIDE WITH POWER-UPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your defense begins to collapse, the right power-up can completely change the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze an advancing horde with <i>Him Kalasha</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant <i>Vajra Bindu</i> along their path and turn the battlefield into a trap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call down a devastating <i>Agni Varsha</i> against clustered enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a <i>Veer Ras</i> to temporarily increase your heroes' attack damage and speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or weaken advancing enemies with a <i>Halahala</i> , slowing them while poison eats away at their health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your resources are limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing when and where to use them is part of the strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/830da9ff9e0b78a566628fab937a16fd.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/830da9ff9e0b78a566628fab937a16fd.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/830da9ff9e0b78a566628fab937a16fd.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔨 GROW STRONGER BETWEEN BATTLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning a battle is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your heroes between encounters and prepare them for the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade heroes, improve permanent Talents, and develop attributes including </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack, Health, Attack Speed, Critical Chance, Critical Damage, and Power-up effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your arsenal through the Armory, where you can collect equipment of different rarities, upgrade valuable gear, and craft stronger equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armour. Helmets. Swords. Shoes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every improvement prepares your heroes for tougher battles ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/f4a74f0e059982afe36efe55bcae5c84.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/f4a74f0e059982afe36efe55bcae5c84.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/f4a74f0e059982afe36efe55bcae5c84.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⭐ CONQUER EVERY LEVEL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey takes you across a growing map filled with increasingly difficult battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage introduces tougher opposition and demands better positioning, stronger heroes, and smarter use of your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving is one thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering the battlefield is another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push for 3-star victories, strengthen your roster, refine your strategy, and prepare for the challenges waiting ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/29e39ba334a2fb1b40dcc5a7c15fb458.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/29e39ba334a2fb1b40dcc5a7c15fb458.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/29e39ba334a2fb1b40dcc5a7c15fb458.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR HEROES. YOUR FORMATION. YOUR STRATEGY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And stand against everything the enemy sends your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle for Amrit awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE BATTLE FOR AMRIT BEGINS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy hordes are advancing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Amrit Manthanam, every battlefield is a test of positioning, timing, and strategy. Deploy mythology-inspired heroes across the battlefield, combine their unique strengths, unleash powerful abilities at critical moments, and stop relentless waves of enemies before they break through your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory isn't just about having stronger heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's about knowing who to deploy, where to position them, and when to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛡️ DEFEND AGAINST THE HORDE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every wave brings a new threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your heroes at strategic positions across the battlefield and build a defense capable of holding back increasingly dangerous enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the battlefield. Adapt your formation. Strengthen weak points. Make every position count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the pressure rises, one decision can be the difference between a perfect defense and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/c6ae870aefcd8b6a641668b0d5e1404a.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/c6ae870aefcd8b6a641668b0d5e1404a.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/c6ae870aefcd8b6a641668b0d5e1404a.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/924787e93254634049a768e3895c9b41.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/924787e93254634049a768e3895c9b41.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/924787e93254634049a768e3895c9b41.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚔️ COMMAND LEGENDARY HEROES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your heroes aren't interchangeable towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero brings a distinct combat role and can change how you approach the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Indravarma — The Divine Guardian</strong></u><br>Blessed by Indra, Indravarma stands at the frontline, using his durability and close-range attacks to hold enemies back while the rest of your forces strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/1a43886dba8cef6bc27624cdc4730356.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/1a43886dba8cef6bc27624cdc4730356.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/1a43886dba8cef6bc27624cdc4730356.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Surya Veer — The Radiant Warrior</strong></u><br>Channel the power of the sun through devastating ranged and area attacks capable of burning through groups of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/7f528539b230c51352b09dcd42ef2ead.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/7f528539b230c51352b09dcd42ef2ead.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/7f528539b230c51352b09dcd42ef2ead.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Amrita Devi — The Celestial Healer</strong></u><br><br><br>Harness the sacred power of Amrit to heal nearby allies and strengthen their effectiveness in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/2ab9f6802c6a788e111b9d2ba5d88a26.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/2ab9f6802c6a788e111b9d2ba5d88a26.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/2ab9f6802c6a788e111b9d2ba5d88a26.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Sharanga — The Divine Archer</strong></u><br>Strike enemies from afar with exceptional speed, range, and precision before they can reach your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/9b410a460255577d2a5cda9ed1017c3e.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/9b410a460255577d2a5cda9ed1017c3e.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/9b410a460255577d2a5cda9ed1017c3e.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Brihaspati — Guru of the Devas</strong></u><br>Command mystical and cosmic powers to summon additional forces and reinforce your defense when the battlefield becomes overwhelming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/a387f15b32271a9c89397ac1b3461cb0.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/a387f15b32271a9c89397ac1b3461cb0.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/a387f15b32271a9c89397ac1b3461cb0.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your formation around their strengths and discover combinations capable of surviving even the fiercest assaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>☄️ TURN THE TIDE WITH POWER-UPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your defense begins to collapse, the right power-up can completely change the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze an advancing horde with <i>Him Kalasha</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant <i>Vajra Bindu</i> along their path and turn the battlefield into a trap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call down a devastating <i>Agni Varsha</i> against clustered enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a <i>Veer Ras</i> to temporarily increase your heroes' attack damage and speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or weaken advancing enemies with a <i>Halahala</i> , slowing them while poison eats away at their health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your resources are limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing when and where to use them is part of the strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/830da9ff9e0b78a566628fab937a16fd.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/830da9ff9e0b78a566628fab937a16fd.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/830da9ff9e0b78a566628fab937a16fd.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔨 GROW STRONGER BETWEEN BATTLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning a battle is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your heroes between encounters and prepare them for the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade heroes, improve permanent Talents, and develop attributes including </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack, Health, Attack Speed, Critical Chance, Critical Damage, and Power-up effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your arsenal through the Armory, where you can collect equipment of different rarities, upgrade valuable gear, and craft stronger equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armour. Helmets. Swords. Shoes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every improvement prepares your heroes for tougher battles ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/f4a74f0e059982afe36efe55bcae5c84.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/f4a74f0e059982afe36efe55bcae5c84.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/f4a74f0e059982afe36efe55bcae5c84.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⭐ CONQUER EVERY LEVEL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey takes you across a growing map filled with increasingly difficult battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage introduces tougher opposition and demands better positioning, stronger heroes, and smarter use of your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving is one thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering the battlefield is another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push for 3-star victories, strengthen your roster, refine your strategy, and prepare for the challenges waiting ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/29e39ba334a2fb1b40dcc5a7c15fb458.poster.avif?t=1787549275\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/29e39ba334a2fb1b40dcc5a7c15fb458.webm?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030120/extras/29e39ba334a2fb1b40dcc5a7c15fb458.mp4?t=1787549275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR HEROES. YOUR FORMATION. YOUR STRATEGY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And stand against everything the enemy sends your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle for Amrit awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Amrit Manthanam is a mythology-inspired tower defense game where legendary heroes are your greatest weapons. Deploy heroes with unique combat roles, unleash devastating power-ups, adapt your strategy against relentless Asur waves, and grow stronger through RPG-style upgrades, talents, and equipment.", "supported_languages": "English", "he